oss\tin\tvalue\tof\tour\tinventory\tdue\tto changes\tin\tmarket\tprices.\tThere\tis\tno\toverlap\tbetween\tthe\tcredit\tand\tmarket exposures\tin\tthe\ttables\tbelow.\n\nThe\tcountry\tof\trisk\tis\tdetermined\tby\tthe\tlocation\tof\tthe\tcounterparty,\tissuer\tor underlier's\tassets,\twhere\tthey\tgenerate\trevenue,\tthe\tcountry\tin\twhich\tthey\tare headquartered,\tand/or\tthe\tgovernment\twhose\tpolicies\taffect\ttheir\tability\tto\trepay their\tobligations.\n\n|  |  |  |  |  |  | Funded | Unfunded | Total |  | Equities |  | Total |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n|  |  | OTC |  | Gross |  | Credit | Credit | Credit |  | and | Credit | Market |\n| in\\tmillions | \\t Loans | Derivatives | Other | \\t\\tFunded | \\tHedges | Exposure | Exposure | \\t\\tExposure | Debt | Other | Derivatives | Exposure |\n| Greece\\nSovereign | \\t $\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t— | $\\t\\t\\t233 | $\\t\\t— | $\\t\\t\\t233 | \\t $\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t(72) | $\\t\\t\\t161 | $\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t— | $\\t\\t\\t161 | \\t$\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t12 | $\\t\\t— | $\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t(2) | $\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t10 |\n| Non-Sovereign | — | 6 | — | 6 | — | 6 | — | 6 | 10 | 3 | 3 | 16 |\n| Total\\tGreece | — | 239 | — | 239 | (72) | 167 | — | 167 | 22 | 3 | 1 | 26 |\n| Ireland\\nSovereign | — | 7 | 125 | 132 | — | 132 | — | 132 | (48) | — | (162) | (210) |\n| Non-Sovereign | 373 | 356 | 127 | 856 | (5) | 851 | 41 | 892 | 291 | 91 | 108 | 490 |\n| Total\\tIreland | 373 | 363 | 252 | 988 | (5) | 983 | 41 | 1,024 | 243 | 91 | (54) | 280 |\n| Italy\\nSovereign | — | 1,704 | 2 | 1,706 | (1,691) | 15 | — | 15 | 371 | — | 62 | 433 |\n| Non-Sovereign | 10 | 527 | 195 | 732 | (31) | 701 | 660 | 1,361 | 361 | (13) | (794) | (446) |\n| Total\\tItaly | 10 | 2,231 | 197 | 2,438 | (1,722) | 716 | 660 | 1,376 | 732 | (13) | (732) | (13) |\n| Portugal\\nSovereign | — | — | 103 | 103 | — | 103 | — | 103 | (27) | — | (73) | (100) |\n| Non-Sovereign | — | 16 | 20 | 36 | — | 36 | — | 36 | 1